{"seq":1,"slug":"why-matchmaking","title":"为何匹配系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/foundations/why-matchmaking","wordCount":1705,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何匹配系统\">为何匹配系统</h1><p>把一万个正在排队的玩家随机两两凑成对局，会发生一件可预测的坏事：胜负在开局之前就已注定。一个老手碰上一个刚下载游戏的人，比赛沦为单方面的处刑——赢的一方索然无味，输的一方愤而退游。匹配系统存在的全部理由，就是不让这件坏事按概率自然发生。它不是锦上添花的功能，而是任何有竞技成分的联机游戏能否留住人的命门。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>匹配系统（matchmaking system）是联机游戏在「玩家点击开始」与「对局真正开打」之间设置的一道分流关卡：它消费评级系统给出的技能估计，把技能与连接质量相近的玩家组进同一局。它存在的前提是随机配对的崩溃——两人技能差越大，预期胜率越偏离五五开，两端玩家都不满意并推高流失。匹配同时服务玩家（公平、刺激、不久等）、厂商（留存、活跃）与竞技生态（排名可信）三方，三方诉求并不一致，因此它优化的从来不是单一指标，而是一个由对局质量、等待时间、连接延迟与参与度加权而成的多目标函数。厘清它上游是评级、下游是联机、旁路是经济设计，才能划出这一系统真正的职责边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"随机配对的崩溃\">随机配对的崩溃</h2><p>要理解匹配的价值，先看没有它会怎样。假设玩家技能服从某个分布，随机抽两人对战，两人技能差的期望相当大。在一个常见的 Elo 体系里，评分差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = 400</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span></span></span></span></span> 时，强者胜率约为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>win</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>400</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.91</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{win}) = \\frac{1}{1 + 10^{-\\Delta/400}} \\approx 0.91</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">win</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1088em;vertical-align:-0.7873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ/400</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7873em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.91</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，随机配对下大量对局的强者胜率逼近九成。对弱者而言这是九成的挫败，对强者而言是九成的无聊——两端都不满意。更糟的是它有正反馈：新手最先遇到的几局如果都是被碾压，留存曲线会在第一天就断崖。匹配系统的第一性目标，就是把每局的预期胜率从「接近确定」拉回到「接近五五开」。</p>\n<p>下图刻画了匹配系统在整条玩家旅程中所处的位置——它夹在「玩家点开始」与「真正开打」之间，是一道几秒钟内必须完成的关卡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[玩家点击开始对战] --&gt; B[进入匹配队列]&#10;  B --&gt; C{评级系统&lt;br/&gt;估计该玩家技能}&#10;  C --&gt; D[在候选池中搜索&lt;br/&gt;技能/延迟相近的人]&#10;  D --&gt; E{找到合格对局?}&#10;  E -- 否, 继续等待 --&gt; F[放宽搜索约束]&#10;  F --&gt; D&#10;  E -- 是 --&gt; G[组局并分配服务器]&#10;  G --&gt; H[对局开始]&#10;  H --&gt; I[结算更新评级]&#10;  I --&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n  A[玩家点击开始对战] --&gt; B[进入匹配队列]\n  B --&gt; C{评级系统&lt;br/&gt;估计该玩家技能}\n  C --&gt; D[在候选池中搜索&lt;br/&gt;技能/延迟相近的人]\n  D --&gt; E{找到合格对局?}\n  E -- 否, 继续等待 --&gt; F[放宽搜索约束]\n  F --&gt; D\n  E -- 是 --&gt; G[组局并分配服务器]\n  G --&gt; H[对局开始]\n  H --&gt; I[结算更新评级]\n  I --&gt; C</pre><p>技能估计的细节属于评级章，本篇只需知道：匹配的输入是「每个人有多强」，输出是「一组预期均势的对局」。Elo 的具体公式在<a href=\"../rating/elo-rating\">Elo 评级</a>中详述，这里只借它说明随机配对为何崩溃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"匹配系统服务的三方\">匹配系统服务的三方</h2><p>匹配看似只为玩家服务，实际上同时回应三方诉求，且三方诉求并不一致。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>核心诉求</th>\n<th>匹配系统的回应</th>\n<th>潜在冲突</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>玩家</td>\n<td>公平、刺激、不久等</td>\n<td>技能相近且快速成局</td>\n<td>公平与快速天然矛盾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>厂商</td>\n<td>留存、活跃、付费</td>\n<td>让玩家觉得「再来一局」</td>\n<td>留存优化可能偏离纯公平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞技生态</td>\n<td>排名可信、天梯有意义</td>\n<td>评分准确、防刷分防小号</td>\n<td>严格防滥用会增加摩擦</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>玩家要的是「这局值得打」；厂商要的是「他明天还会回来」；竞技生态要的是「天梯第一名确实是最强的」。一个只优化公平的系统可能让休闲玩家觉得「每局都打得好累」，而一个只优化留存的系统可能让硬核玩家觉得「天梯没有公信力」。匹配系统的设计史，本质上是在这三方之间反复校准的历史。这种多目标的张力会在<a href=\"matchmaking-goals\">匹配目标谱系</a>里展开成一条完整的谱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"它到底在优化什么\">它到底在优化什么</h2><p>把上面的诉求收敛，匹配系统优化的核心其实是一个隐含的目标函数，粗略可写成几项的加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Score</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Quality</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Wait</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Latency</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Engagement</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Score} = w_q \\cdot \\text{Quality} - w_t \\cdot \\text{Wait} - w_l \\cdot \\text{Latency} + w_e \\cdot \\text{Engagement}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Quality</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Wait</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Latency</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Engagement</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 Quality 衡量对局的均势程度，Wait 是排队时长，Latency 是连接质量，Engagement 是某些系统额外引入的留存项。这四项几乎两两冲突——提高 Quality 通常要扩大搜索时间从而抬高 Wait；压低 Latency 要缩小地理范围从而牺牲 Quality。不同游戏给这些权重赋的值天差地别，这正是各家匹配「手感」不同的根源。这个权衡的量化形态是下一篇<a href=\"matchmaking-tradeoffs\">匹配质量与等待权衡</a>的主题，本篇只点明：匹配从不是「找最公平的对手」，而是「在多个互斥目标间求一个能接受的折中」。</p>\n<p>需要强调权重并非一成不变。同一款游戏的排位模式与休闲模式，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可以差出数倍；赛事服与平民服更是两套配置。匹配系统因此往往不是一套算法，而是一族可调策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"匹配在游戏全局中的位置\">匹配在游戏全局中的位置</h2><p>匹配不是孤立模块，它的上下游都连着别的系统，理解边界能避免把不属于它的责任硬塞进来。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>上游是评级</strong>：匹配消费技能估计，但不负责怎么估。新手不确定性、团队评分这些问题归<a href=\"../rating/glicko-uncertainty\">Glicko 与不确定性</a>与<a href=\"../rating/trueskill-teams\">TrueSkill 与团队</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>下游是联机</strong>：匹配把人配好就交棒，之后的状态同步、延迟补偿是<a href=\"../../game-networking/state-synchronization/authoritative-server\">联机架构</a>的事；匹配只把「ping 是否可接受」当作一个配对约束。</li>\n<li><strong>旁路是经济与设计</strong>：评分映射到段位、赛季奖励的设计属于<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/tuning/ab-testing-retention\">游戏数值平衡</a>；匹配只产出原始评分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这些边界钉死，匹配系统的职责就清晰了：在评级给出的技能图景上，在联机给出的连接约束下，几秒钟内组出一批让三方都能接受的对局。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>随机配对会让大量对局在开局前就分出胜负，两端玩家都不满意，留存崩塌——这是匹配存在的根本理由。</li>\n<li>匹配同时服务玩家、厂商、竞技生态三方，三方诉求不一致，设计就是在它们之间校准。</li>\n<li>匹配优化的是一个多目标加权函数（质量、等待、延迟、留存），各项互斥，权重决定「手感」。</li>\n<li>匹配的上游是评级、下游是联机、旁路是经济设计；分清边界才不会把别人的活揽进来。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本篇点到的质量-等待张力，完整量化见 <a href=\"matchmaking-tradeoffs\">匹配质量与等待权衡</a>。</li>\n<li>目标多元性展开为一条谱，见 <a href=\"matchmaking-goals\">匹配目标谱系</a>。</li>\n<li>匹配交棒之后的连接与同步，见 <a href=\"../../game-networking/state-synchronization/authoritative-server\">权威服务器模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何匹配系统","id":"为何匹配系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"随机配对的崩溃","id":"随机配对的崩溃"},{"level":2,"text":"匹配系统服务的三方","id":"匹配系统服务的三方"},{"level":2,"text":"它到底在优化什么","id":"它到底在优化什么"},{"level":2,"text":"匹配在游戏全局中的位置","id":"匹配在游戏全局中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"匹配质量与等待权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/foundations/matchmaking-tradeoffs"}}